				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">horti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tib.
					1, 1, 21</span></i>
			 (25): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arva,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
				4</span></i>
			 (5), 7, 81; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pomosi Tiburis arva, Col. poët. 10,
					138: corona,</span>”
				<i>a chaplet of fruits</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
				4</span></i>
			 (5), 2, 17.</div>
